// Status codes returned by this interface. drsuapi methods return Win32 error codes
// (a ULONG/DWORD return value), NOT NTSTATUS — so StatusSuccess is ERROR_SUCCESS (0).
// Below are the generic Win32 codes plus the directory-replication (DRA) block from
